WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.004 --> 00:00:04.005
"Uncle! Come back!"

2
00:00:04.025 --> 00:00:05.986
Aladdin screamed.

3
00:00:06.006 --> 00:00:06.726
"Don't leave me!"

4
00:00:07.286 --> 00:00:09.047
Again and again, Aladdin called out for help.

5
00:00:09.067 --> 00:00:10.028
But of course Magrib did not answer.

6
00:00:10.048 --> 00:00:33.052
The magician had left.

7
00:00:33.072 --> 00:00:34.673
"I'm trapped," Aladdin said, alone and frightened.

8
00:00:34.693 --> 00:00:36.094
"It's so dark and cold."

9
00:00:37.556 --> 00:00:39.837
But then Aladdin felt a bit of hope.

10
00:00:41.158 --> 00:00:45.421
"I'll go back to the garden," he thought, "and sit on the grass under a tree.

11
00:00:46.682 --> 00:00:49.424
Maybe then I'll be able to think of a way to escape."

12
00:00:51.566 --> 00:00:54.748
Aladdin went down the steps and into the golden chamber.

13
00:00:56.029 --> 00:00:57.009
But it had changed.

14
00:00:57.630 --> 00:01:00.152
Now the chamber was filled only with shadows.

15
00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.182
He ran to the garden door and stood in front of it.

16
00:01:04.202 --> 00:01:07.145
"My name is Aladdin!

17
00:01:07.505 --> 00:01:08.887
I command you to open!"

18
00:01:09.187 --> 00:01:10.108
the boy shouted.

19
00:01:11.189 --> 00:01:12.950
But the door did not move.

20
00:01:13.671 --> 00:01:15.152
Aladdin said the words again.

21
00:01:15.813 --> 00:01:16.634
Nothing happened.

22
00:01:16.654 --> 00:01:21.298
"The magic words do not work," said Aladdin.

23
00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:28.044
He walked back through the chamber, climbed back up the steps, and sat down.

24
00:01:30.188 --> 00:01:32.090
"I did everything Uncle told me to do.

25
00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:34.491
I found the lamp and brought it back."

26
00:01:35.032 --> 00:01:36.413
Aladdin shook his head.

27
00:01:36.433 --> 00:01:39.355
"I would have given the lamp to Uncle."

28
00:01:39.695 --> 00:01:40.396
He sighed.

29
00:01:40.416 --> 00:01:43.238
"Why didn't he help me up the last step?"

30
00:01:44.919 --> 00:01:47.281
Aladdin took a glass apple from his pocket.

31
00:01:47.301 --> 00:01:50.503
"I wish I could trade this for a real apple.

32
00:01:50.983 --> 00:01:51.984
I'm so hungry."

33
00:01:53.285 --> 00:01:56.528
Many hours went by, and he couldn't do anything but think.

34
00:01:58.236 --> 00:02:02.298
"Magrib is not my uncle at all," Aladdin finally decided.

35
00:02:02.318 --> 00:02:06.901
"He is a liar—an evil magician.

36
00:02:07.481 --> 00:02:09.322
And I think he left me here to die."

37
00:02:10.563 --> 00:02:12.404
A tear rolled down the boy's cheek.

38
00:02:13.565 --> 00:02:17.527
When he raised his hand to wipe it away, he saw the ring on his finger.

39
00:02:18.787 --> 00:02:20.528
He laughed a sad, little laugh.

40
00:02:20.548 --> 00:02:26.752
"My uncle—Magrib put this ring on my finger.

41
00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:30.085
He said it would protect me from danger and fear.

42
00:02:31.306 --> 00:02:32.686
Well, I am in danger right now!

43
00:02:32.706 --> 00:02:35.207
And I am very afraid!

44
00:02:35.848 --> 00:02:37.028
So that was a lie too.

45
00:02:37.808 --> 00:02:38.889
This ring is useless!"

46
00:02:40.690 --> 00:02:45.832
Angry now, Aladdin decided to throw the ring away, but it was tight on his finger.

47
00:02:47.073 --> 00:02:49.374
So he began to pull and twist the ring.

48
00:02:50.654 --> 00:02:54.436
He couldn't get it off, but a cloud of bright smoke appeared.

49
00:02:56.524 --> 00:03:01.148
Within seconds, the smoke disappeared, and a funny, little man stood there!

50
00:03:02.569 --> 00:03:06.853
He wore wide pants and a cap with tiny bells hanging along the edge.

51
00:03:07.493 --> 00:03:10.216
His skin was the color of dried apricots.

52
00:03:10.236 --> 00:03:14.879
"The genie of the ring has come!"

53
00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:16.301
squeaked the fellow.

54
00:03:16.601 --> 00:03:18.382
The bells on his cap jingled.

55
00:03:18.402 --> 00:03:22.266
"The one who wears the ring is my master!

56
00:03:22.886 --> 00:03:24.948
Ask me for anything and I will do it.

57
00:03:25.620 --> 00:03:26.741
I am your slave!"

58
00:03:28.761 --> 00:03:30.902
Aladdin had never seen a genie before.

59
00:03:32.123 --> 00:03:35.024
He thought a genie would be tall and have big muscles.

60
00:03:36.845 --> 00:03:40.246
This genie was smaller than Aladdin, and he was skinny.

61
00:03:41.987 --> 00:03:45.348
Aladdin jumped to his feet, laughing with surprise and joy.

62
00:03:45.368 --> 00:03:47.909
"I can ask for anything?

63
00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:49.650
Then get me out of here!"

64
00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:52.471
"Your wish is my command!"

65
00:03:52.972 --> 00:03:53.632
said the genie.

66
00:03:55.096 --> 00:03:59.400
Suddenly the light became so bright that Aladdin had to shut his eyes!

67
00:04:01.201 --> 00:04:06.025
But then slowly he opened one eye, and then he opened the other.

68
00:04:07.507 --> 00:04:09.929
He looked to the left, and he looked to the right.

69
00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:15.113
He opened his eyes wider and looked up into the bright, blue sky.

70
00:04:15.133 --> 00:04:17.195
"I'm free!"

71
00:04:17.595 --> 00:04:18.276
he shouted.
